{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Grimslair demo allows you to play the game for up to 3 in-game days (all features from the game are unlocked).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054890/extras/9daf43c6681adb1a5ccbb485ef3b1a77.poster.avif?t=1759599803\" width=583 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054890/extras/9daf43c6681adb1a5ccbb485ef3b1a77.webm?t=1759599803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Grimslair</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t level up\u2014your cards do!</strong><br>Descend into <strong>Grimslair</strong>, a world engineered by the Grim Reaper to judge you. Cooperate with him\u2014or defy him\u2014as you hunt for a way to bring your <strong>girlfriend</strong> back from the dead. Explore hostile biomes, craft shelters, tools, weapons/armor, rescue lost pets, and uncover personal notes you left yourself to learn why you were drawn to this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Card-first progression:</i></strong><i> level up individual cards, unlock new effects, and build synergies that reshape how you fight and survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054890/extras/e378f4e84b5fe78522b3eecda90b9307.poster.avif?t=1759599803\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co